(   1D12
    1-4     "Chaos Space Marine with Bolter (20 Points)"
    5-8     "Chaos Space Marine with Bolter (25 Points)"
    9-11    "Chaos Space Marine with Bolter (30 Points)"
   12-12    "Chaos Space Marine with Bolter (35 Points)" & Xenos-Wargear()
